  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Bring a medium saucepan of lightly salted water to boil. Peel potato and cut into large chunks.\n• Cook potato in boiling water until easily pierced with a knife, 10-15 mins.\n• Drain and return to saucepan. Add milk, salt and ½ the butter and mash until smooth. Cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/621f23ff169e5a19621e699f/step-b0cd20c8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, grate carrot. Thinly slice brown onion. Thinly slice zucchini into half-moons. Finely chop garlic. Drain and rinse red kidney beans.\n• Preheat grill to high.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/621f23ff169e5a19621e699f/step-f415a6f8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over high heat. Cook onion, carrot and zucchini, until softened, 6-8 min.\n• Reduce heat to medium. Stir in garlic seasoning and garlic, until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in red kidney beans, passata, vegetable stock powder, the remaining butter and a splash of water. Simmer until slightly reduced, 1-2 mins.\n• Stir in baby spinach leaves and grated Parmesan. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/621f23ff169e5a19621e699f/step-c1ab7df2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer filling mixture to a medium baking dish and top with mash.\n• Grill until lightly golden, 5-8 mins.\n• Divide bean pie between plates.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/621f23ff169e5a19621e699f/step-03eed169.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
